      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JAGGERY (1) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Jester Beach (24.19) in a Mix 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings 11 times from 18 attempts. Key chance in this line up. CALAMITY CORNER (2) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last four runs. Last start finished 3rd in a Mix 5 on August 16 over 407m at this track behind Art Of Deception beaten 6 lengths (24.15). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Overdue and is among the main hopes. VANZANT HAYZE (7) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing third (24.24) at this track in a Mix 5 over 407m. Expecting another good run. ROCKY RIDE (8) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
